# SHUTTERBUG: the prologue teaches the gun, the rings, the camera and the
# bulbs with a tip at each step; finished without a single point, its clear
# screen shows a message of its own.
game shutterbug
cheat run 1
cheat god
waituntil tip == 0 600
waituntil tip == 3 2400
waituntil state == 6 3000
expect zero_prologue == 1
expect score == 0
expect stage == 0
